# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This working tree is an unpacked NASM distribution that hosts the ZenithOS
# project at its root.  Track only the ZenithOS sources and tooling; the NASM
# distribution files stay local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!ROADMAP.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE.md
!boot.asm
!build.js
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src/
!src/**
!tools/
!tools/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!screenshots/
!screenshots/**
!.github/
!.github/**

# Build products / caches are never committed.
build/
node_modules/
tools/vendor/
*.bin
*.img
*.o
*.elf
*.log
*.tmp
nasm.exe
ndisasm.exe
